<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Feb 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- The president of Mozambique's national assembly, Eduardo Mulembwe, completed a three-day visit to Angola where he met several delegates from Angola's parliament.</p>
<p>- Sixteen public telephone booths will be installed in the cities of Benguela and Lobito, the national telephone company said.</p>
